# Read upstream before changing runner env

Do not invent or flip runner env / recreate flags from logs alone.

1. Read this repo’s `README.md`, `up.sh`, and compose comments.
2. Confirm keys against [myoung34 README env table](https://github.com/myoung34/docker-github-actions-runner/blob/master/README.md) and [Usage wiki](https://github.com/myoung34/docker-github-actions-runner/wiki/Usage).
3. Never default to `docker compose up --force-recreate` with reusage — same `RUNNER_NAME` + live session → Conflict.

```text
# ❌
docker compose up -d --force-recreate
DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE: "false"    # still truthy
image pin 2.338.2 as forever default

# ✅
bash up.sh                 # up -d --no-recreate
bash up.sh --upgrade       # pull; stop; wait; up -d if digest changed
latest + DISABLE_AUTO_UPDATE=true + CONFIGURED_* + DISABLE_AUTOMATIC_DEREGISTRATION=true
```
